{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し第三回目だよ!!\nあっ鼻がつまりました。\nてっしゅを!!\nティッシュ下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、お風呂はシャワー派？\n湯船に入るよ。\n入浴剤も入れる。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/3240556/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、今までに一番もらってびっくりしたものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん。\nでもフィギュア超嬉しいな〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、オフの日に一番遊ぶメンバーは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまは、あんまり遊んだことない〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/3240556/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、防寒対策は何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももひき(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、世の中の出来事で興味のあることは何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンガが存在する事〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、設楽派？日村派？カメハメ派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメハメ派"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、趣味とかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヲタクです。マンガヲタクです。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、コメント全部読んでる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたく読ませて頂いております!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、アイドルの中で誰推し？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂推し。かわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/3240556/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、カラオケ行く？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行かない〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、宇宙柄のリュック持ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない。ぜひ原宿に買いに行くしか!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、京都来たことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族旅行で行ったよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ素晴らしい町ですね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、好きな花は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かすみ草"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、年寄りなんで、握手会行くの疲れるんだけど、どうしたらいい？ちなみに生駒の１つ歳上【笑】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだあなた若いよ。\nさぁ気合いをいれて来るのだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、生駒市行ったことある？生駒山上遊園地行ったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないのです。\n沢山の生駒さんに会いたいな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/3240556/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、秋田県の星空は綺麗？\n綺麗よ〜☆\n見に行くといいね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、記者会見のフラッシュってまぶしい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、好きな言葉は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思えば叶うです。\nこれは本当に大切。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！\nまずはこの辺でー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/3240556/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}